cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite it as below and also cite the EVBattery dataset."
title: "battery-soh-ev-online: capacity and SOH estimation from everyday EV charging snippets"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible pipeline that estimates absolute battery capacity (Ah) and
  state of health (SOH) from a single everyday electric-vehicle charging
  session, using 114 features from coulomb-count quantities and incremental
  capacity (dQ/dV) shape. Validated on the full Tsinghua EVBattery dataset
  (464 cars, 173,437 charging sessions) with a leave-cars-out protocol.
  Reference implementation: 0.826 Ah RMSE / 0.832 R2 / 1.94 SOH percentage
  points on unseen vehicles, with calibrated 90% prediction intervals.
version: 1.0.0
